ry 因减肥药芬芬丧命。当身体成为商业资产，惩罚与捷径都通向同一个结局。 Cautionary Tales with Tim Harford Cautionary Tales The Weight of Fame: A Hollywood Tragedy 好莱坞 身体标准 减肥药 商业伦理 合同条款 医疗风险 lipectomy fen-phen primary pulmonary hypertension (PPH)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-cautionary-制片厂的合同里写着-女演员的身体不得改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.omnycontent.com/d/playlist/e73c998e-6e60-432f-8610-ae210140c5b1/c0ae8c6e-22f0-4e9b-ac1c-ae390037ac53/7f5a4714-6b10-4ccf-a424-ae390037ac70/image.jpg?t=1650471153&amp;size=Medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>女演员合同锁死体重：增重即违约，减肥即送命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1920 年代女演员 Molly 因体重增加被片方雪藏、走上手术台；1990 年代新娘 Mary 因减肥药芬芬丧命。当身体成为商业资产，惩罚与捷径都通向同一个结局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">身体标准</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\"\n data-hay=\"AMD收购Talus：把AI模型烧进芯片，每秒跑1.7万token AMD收购了Talus，一家为特定AI模型定制芯片、实现每秒17,000 tokens的初创公司。这标志着AI推理走向非可编程、模型专用芯片的方向。 TechTechPotato TechTechPotato Why did AMD just buy this REALLY WEIRD chip company? AI芯片 AMD Talus 模型定制 推理加速 SRAM reticle size agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-techtechpotato-amd收购talus-押注模型定制芯片的未来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://i4.ytimg.com/vi/3MKRjt59hh4/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AMD收购Talus：把AI模型烧进芯片，每秒跑1.7万token</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AMD收购了Talus，一家为特定AI模型定制芯片、实现每秒17,000 tokens的初创公司。这标志着AI推理走向非可编程、模型专用芯片的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</